    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'FR Place:Floren Forest' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Floren_Forest.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. It replaces every earlier note in this record about the prize wheel or its prizes."},
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1232 (testers' notes A52): the battle page's primary goal is 'Defeat Ozymandias!' (lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Floren_Forest.html), bonus 'Rescue the Floren Budlings! - 0/4'; FR_Mob:Ozymandias, a Stone Head boss 'all the way down the right hand path, hiding behind a barrier' / 'At the end of the dungeon with the Evil Floren'; the mobs category: Evil Floren, Floren Sprout, Flowerchild, Great White Snake, Ozymandias, Twisted Serpent, Withered Floren"},
